WEBVTT

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:05.732
[birds squawking]

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.657
[Hiccup] This is Berk,

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:19.204
the best-kept secret
this side of, well, anywhere.

00:01:19.829 --> 00:01:22.999
Granted, it may not look like
much, but this wet heap of rock

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:26.211
packs more than a few surprises.

00:01:26.461 --> 00:01:28.254
[air whooshing]

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:30.048
[bleating]

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:35.428
Life here is amazing,
just not for the faint of heart.

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:37.722
You see, where most folks enjoy hobbies

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:39.974
like whittling or needlepoint,

00:01:40.141 --> 00:01:42.644
we Berkians prefer

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:45.563
a little something we like to call

00:01:47.982 --> 00:01:49.818
dragon racing!

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.153
[people cheering]

00:01:56.658 --> 00:01:58.118
Whoo!

00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:01.621
[bleats]

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.749
[Snotlout] Whoa! [laughs]

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:08.044
I'm sorry, Fishlegs. Did you want that?

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.295
Oh! [grunts]

00:02:09.754 --> 00:02:12.006
[Fishlegs] Snotlout, that was mine!

00:02:12.173 --> 00:02:13.341
Here you go, babe.

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:16.386
Did I tell you that you look
amazing today, because you do.

00:02:16.594 --> 00:02:19.347
Ugh. Come on, Barf.
It's starting to stink around here.

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:22.517
Nope. Still hates you.
Let's blow this place, Belch!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:23.643
[yells]

00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:25.687
[Tuffnut] All right!

00:02:27.438 --> 00:02:29.190
[people cheering]

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:32.986
[Tuffnut laughs] Oh, yeah!

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.030
Ha-ha! That's nine for the Twins,

00:02:36.364 --> 00:02:38.366
Astrid lags with three.

00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:42.370
Fishlegs and Snotlout trail with none.

00:02:42.537 --> 00:02:43.955
And Hiccup is…

00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:47.333
Nowhere to be found. Hmm.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.628
Scared him off with
the big talk, didn't you, Stoick?

00:02:52.964 --> 00:02:54.215
What are you doing, Snotlout?

00:02:54.424 --> 00:02:55.717
They're gonna win now.

00:02:55.884 --> 00:02:58.261
She's my princess.
Whatever she wants, she gets.

00:02:58.386 --> 00:03:01.431
[Astrid] Ruffnut?
Didn't she try to bury you alive?

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:03.141
[Snotlout] Only for a few hours.

00:03:05.268 --> 00:03:09.105
[Hiccup] Now, dragons used to
be a bit of a problem here,

00:03:09.272 --> 00:03:10.565
but that was five years ago.

00:03:10.732 --> 00:03:12.609
Now, they have all moved in.

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:14.903
And really, why wouldn't they?

00:03:15.069 --> 00:03:16.905
We have custom stables,

00:03:17.071 --> 00:03:19.073
all-you-can-eat feeding stations,

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.576
a full-service dragon wash,

00:03:22.118 --> 00:03:26.873
even top-of-the-line
fire prevention if I do say so myself.

00:03:28.291 --> 00:03:29.626
[chuckles] It's time, Gobber.

00:03:29.792 --> 00:03:31.294
Righty-ho. Last lap!

00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:34.589
[blowing horn]

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:38.009
The Black Sheep! Come on, Stormfly.

00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:39.928
We can still win this thing!

00:03:40.011 --> 00:03:41.012
[all cheering]

00:03:41.763 --> 00:03:43.765
-[Ruffnut] Come on, Barf!
-[Tuffnut] Let's go!

00:03:44.682 --> 00:03:45.683
Go, Meatlug!

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:47.685
[Astrid] Whoo-hoo!

00:03:47.769 --> 00:03:49.520
[Fishlegs] Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:51.940
This is your big moment.

00:03:52.482 --> 00:03:54.025
Have a nice flight!

00:03:57.403 --> 00:03:58.446
Up, up, up!

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:01.282
[bleats]

00:04:02.033 --> 00:04:03.201
-[Astrid] No!
-[Fishlegs] Yes!

00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:04.827
Good job, Meatlug.

00:04:05.787 --> 00:04:08.206
Here you go, darling. Mine is worth ten.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.291
Yeah! The Black Sheep!

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:13.962
[Astrid] You guys are
fighting for Ruffnut?

00:04:14.128 --> 00:04:15.296
I'm totally winning!

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:17.548
We're winning together! [screams]

00:04:18.007 --> 00:04:19.050
[Snotlout] Oh, no!

00:04:19.509 --> 00:04:21.135
[cheering]

00:04:21.302 --> 00:04:23.221
Whoo! No one can stop me now!

00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:25.890
Except for me. We're attached, genius.

00:04:26.057 --> 00:04:28.559
-Quit trying to steal all my glory!
-Hey!

00:04:29.644 --> 00:04:30.687
Get them, Astrid!

00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:33.773
-[Tuffnut] It's my glory!
-[Ruffnut] Always ruining everything!

00:04:33.856 --> 00:04:36.526
-[Tuffnut] No sheep, no glory!
-[Astrid] Gotcha! [laughs]

00:04:37.151 --> 00:04:38.152
-Whoa!
-Astrid!

00:04:38.361 --> 00:04:39.612
Well played! [laughs]

00:04:39.696 --> 00:04:40.905
[sighs]

00:04:40.989 --> 00:04:43.366
-That's my future daughter-in-law!
-[grunts]

00:04:47.704 --> 00:04:49.539
-Excuse me.
-Stormfly!

00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:50.957
-[grunts]
-Oh!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.084
-[weapon clangs]
-[all exclaim in shock]

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:55.169
Whoa!

00:04:55.253 --> 00:04:56.754
[grunting]

00:04:58.881 --> 00:05:00.300
[people cheering]

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:05.388
That's 13! Astrid takes the game!

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.432
[cheering]

00:05:07.515 --> 00:05:10.268
[Hiccup] Yep, Berk is pretty much perfect.

00:05:10.351 --> 00:05:12.145
All of my hard work has paid off.

00:05:12.228 --> 00:05:15.732
And it's a good thing, too, because
with Vikings on the backs of dragons…

00:05:15.815 --> 00:05:17.525
-[Astrid] Whoo-hoo!
-[exclaims in shock]

00:05:17.608 --> 00:05:19.986
…the world just got a whole lot bigger.

00:05:20.445 --> 00:05:22.905
[upbeat music playing]

00:05:36.961 --> 00:05:38.004
[Hiccup] Yeah!

00:05:40.923 --> 00:05:42.550
♪ Let the wind carry us ♪

00:05:42.633 --> 00:05:45.511
♪ To the clouds, hurry up, all right ♪

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:49.390
♪ We can travel so far ♪

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:53.186
♪ As our eyes can see ♪

00:05:54.562 --> 00:06:00.568
♪ We go where no one goes ♪

00:06:01.444 --> 00:06:05.281
♪ We slow for no one ♪

00:06:05.364 --> 00:06:10.620
♪ Get out of our way… ♪

00:06:20.546 --> 00:06:22.173
So what do you think, bud?

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:23.966
You wanna give this another shot?

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.176
[grumbles]

00:06:25.259 --> 00:06:27.261
Toothless! It will be fine.

00:06:30.431 --> 00:06:31.557
Ready?

00:06:33.684 --> 00:06:35.103
[yelling]

00:06:38.397 --> 00:06:40.608
Yeah!

00:06:44.487 --> 00:06:46.072
Yeah!

00:06:54.038 --> 00:06:55.081
[Hiccup yells]

